== Artifacts ==
Artifacts are unlocked through {{Keyword|node|Refine Tree Node 99}}, purchased with 1e1000 RfP. There are four different artifacts, one for each card suit. Each Tarot resource can be converted into their golden form using the Flush button on the right side of the tab. Doing so will grant you the respective amount of golden resources, but a ^0.001 resource generation penalty will be incurred, though this will weaken gradually over 10 hours. The Flush button will also be on cooldown for 10% of this duration. This cooldown can be reduced with levels in {{Keyword|node|Refine Tree Node 100}}, and Relic 58, among many other means.

Here are the four artifacts:<gallery>
File:Crystal Mirror.png|A complete Crystal Mirror artifact, for Swords
File:Magic Skull.png|A complete Magic Skull artifact, for Wands
File:Prosperity Engine.png|A complete Prosperity Engine artifact, for Pentacles
File:Emotional Vessel.png|A complete Emotional Vessel artifact, for Cups
</gallery>

